{"type":"message","id":"b898520b","parentId":"72f9ca4b","timestamp":"2026-04-27T06:19:17.374Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n现在知道问题了：\n1. 微信插件的manifest缺少channelConfigs元数据，所以配置界面/自动配置不生效\n2. 虽然channels里已经有openclaw-weixin的节点，但是配置不全，没有enabled:true，也没有accounts账号配置\n3. 而且用户说已经login了，那可能是配置没同步到channels里？\n\n那现在先检查一下插件是不是已经启用了，然后手动补全微信channel的配置，首先先看openclaw plugins show openclaw-weixin看看插件信息，然后再补全配置。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ba8soo817id6fmno207hlobu","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw plugins show openclaw-weixin"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777270747546,"responseId":"021777270748914ea9dc72e4279a1799608cb64438f5f0fcb2936"}}
