{"type":"message","id":"2339c9b1","parentId":"830dba75","timestamp":"2026-04-27T06:19:42.211Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n直接告诉用户问题和解决方法吧，根据已经有的信息：\n问题原因：\n1. 微信插件本身的manifest缺少channelConfigs元数据（官方插件的小问题），导致自动配置通道不生效\n2. 虽然你已经登录了微信插件，但是通道配置没有自动补全到channels里，现在只生成了空的配置节点\n\n解决方法：\n1. 手动启用微信通道并补全配置：\n运行 openclaw config set channels.openclaw-weixin.enabled true\n2. 然后重启网关让配置生效：\nopenclaw gateway restart\n3. 重启后查看通道列表确认：\nopenclaw channels list\n\n如果还是不行的话，需要手动添加账号配置，不过一般登录后账号信息会存在插件的私有配置里，只要启用通道就能自动读取。\n\n还有那个manifest的警告不影响使用，只是配置提示的问题，后续插件更新会修复。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"### 问题原因已定位：\n1. **插件自身小问题**：微信插件的manifest缺少`channelConfigs`元数据，导致登录后不会自动生成完整的通道配置\n2. **配置不完整**：当前你的配置里已经有`openclaw-weixin`通道节点，但是缺少`enabled: true`启用标记，也没有自动关联你登录的账号信息\n\n---\n### 解决步骤：\n#### 1. 手动启用微信通道\n```bash\nopenclaw config set channels.openclaw-weixin.enabled true\n```\n#### 2. 重启网关加载配置\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n#### 3. 验证通道是否正常\n```bash\nopenclaw channels list\n```\n重启后微信通道会自动读取你之前登录的账号信息，不需要重新登录。\n\n> 那个`channelConfigs`的警告不影响实际使用，是插件元数据缺失的提示，后续微信插件更新会自动修复，不需要你手动处理。\n\n如果重启后还是看不到微信通道，可以手动执行`openclaw channels add openclaw-weixin`强制添加通道配置。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777270767432,"responseId":"0217772707691415e45075bb6934efb4c3a267db809af1d6f08c8"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3e7fcd16","parentId":"2339c9b1","timestamp":"2026-04-27T13:01:30.833Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System (untrusted): [2026-04-27 06:18:23 UTC] Exec completed (fresh-wi, code 0) :: -weixin without channelConfigs │ │ @tencent- │ openclaw │ openclaw │ loaded │ global:openclaw-weixin/index.ts │ 2.1.10 │ │ weixin/ │ -weixin │ │ │ OpenClaw Weixin channel │ │ │ we…\nSystem (untrusted): [2026-04-27 06:19:30 UTC] Exec completed (vivid-ro, code 0) :: n without channelConfigs │ │ - WARN openclaw-weixin: channel plugin manifest declares │ │ openclaw-weixin without channelConfigs metadata; add │ │ (/home/node/.openclaw/extensions…\nSystem (untrusted): [2026-04-27 06:19:50 UTC] Exec completed (glow-cre, code 1) :: Config warnings: - plugins.entries.openclaw-weixin: plugin openclaw-weixin: channel plugin manifest declares openclaw-weixin without channelConfigs metadata; add openclaw.plugin.j…\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b51c1916b1ca0ee84efee2404845\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-04-27 13:00 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b51c1916b1ca0ee84efee2404845]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: node@bb5f9f91215d:/app$ openclaw config set channels.openclaw-weixin.enabled true\nConfig warnings:\n- plugins.entries.openclaw-weixin: plugin openclaw-weixin: channel plugin manifest declares openclaw-weixin without channelConfigs metadata; add openclaw.plugin.json#channelConfigs so config schema and setup surfaces work before runtime loads\n\n🦞 OpenClaw 2026.4.24 (unknown) — Less clicking, more shipping, fewer \"where did that file go\" moments.\n\n│\n◇ Config warnings ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n│ │\n│ - plugins.entries.openclaw-weixin: plugin openclaw-weixin: channel plugin manifest │\n│ declares openclaw-weixin without channelConfigs metadata; add │\n│ openclaw.plugin.json#channelConfigs so config schema and setup surfaces work before │\n│ runtime loads │\n│ │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\nConfig warnings:\n- plugins.entries.openclaw-weixin: plugin openclaw-weixin: channel plugin manifest declares openclaw-weixin without channelConfigs metadata; add openclaw.plugin.json#channelConfigs so config schema and setup surfaces work before runtime loads\nConfig overwrite: /home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json (sha256 defa76eff7f884fca7255b893c50437d1638be4d9401ca4dc6c06e6b00e0c69c -> b31823bb9bdc019626317f32a40ebb15330add328723a5705526c90c781b04d7, backup=/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json.bak)\nConfig warnings:\n- plugins.entries.openclaw-weixin: plugin openclaw-weixin: channel plugin manifest declares openclaw-weixin without channelConfigs metadata; add openclaw.plugin.json#channelConfigs so config schema and setup surfaces work before runtime loads\nUpdated channels.openclaw-weixin.enabled. Restart the gateway to apply.\n\n分析一下这个提示"}],"timestamp":1777294890829}}
{"type":"message","id":"494307b9","parentId":"3e7fcd16","timestamp":"2026-04-27T13:01:48.451Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户现在需要我分析刚才执行set命令后的那些提示，首先分清楚哪些是正常的，哪些是需要处理的对吧？\n首先，先把提示分两类：1. 警告类（那个channelConfigs的提示），2. 成功类（配置更新成功的提示）\n首先说那个一直出现的警告：首先告诉用户这个警告是完全不影响使用的，是微信插件自己的元数据缺失问题，和用户的配置没关系，是插件开发者那边没补全manifest里的channelConfigs字段，只是影响配置UI的自动生成，运行时功能完全正常，后续插件更新会自动修，不用用户管。\n然后说成功的部分：配置已经成功写入了，提示说要重启网关生效，之前已经告诉过用户要重启的对吧？然后可以确认下，现在配置已经改对了，重启后微信通道就会加载了。\n还要可以补充下，那个备份提示也正常，openclaw每次改配置都会自动备份上一个版本，防止改坏了可以回滚，很安全。\n还要解释下为什么这个警告一直出现：因为每次调用config相关命令的时候，OpenClaw都会校验所有插件的元数据，所以这个警告会一直弹，直到微信插件更新修复这个元数据问题，但是完全不影响功能，不用在意。\n最后可以提醒下现在执行重启网关的命令就可以了，然后验证通道是否正常。\n对吧，逻辑要清晰，先解释警告，再解释成功部分，最后给后续操作。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"### 提示内容分两部分说明：\n---\n#### 🔔 第一部分：反复出现的 `channelConfigs` 警告\n**完全不影响使用，不需要处理**\n这个警告是微信插件自身的元数据缺失问题：插件的 `openclaw.plugin.json` 配置文件里没有填写`channelConfigs`字段，只是会影响配置UI的自动生成能力，插件的运行时收发消息、登录状态等所有功能完全正常。\n后续微信插件官方更新后会自动修复这个警告，你不需要做任何操作。\n\n---\n#### ✅ 第二部分：配置更新成功提示\n你的操作已经生效：\n1. 微信通道的`enabled: true`标记已经成功写入配置文件\n2. OpenClaw自动生成了旧配置的备份（`/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json.bak`），防止配置改坏可以回滚\n3. 提示已经明确说明**需要重启网关生效**\n\n---\n### 现在执行后续操作即可：\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway restart\n# 重启后验证通道\nopenclaw channels list\n```\n重启后微信通道会自动加载你之前登录的账号信息，就可以正常使用了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777294890837,"responseId":"0217772948911958ac096c5b7437945ca13d80bc44bde5bdf36f3"}}
